1
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,899
Hi! I'm Pip! First night!

2
00:00:04,939 --> 00:00:08,952
Whoa. Is that...
the edge of the universe?!

3
00:00:08,992 --> 00:00:11,708
Yep. Don't lean on the glass.

4
00:00:11,748 --> 00:00:15,040
Why? What happens
if I lean on the glass?

5
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,412
We hire someone new.

6
00:00:19,282 --> 00:00:24,958
Welcome to Void Mart, Pip!
We are open until
the heat death of the universe.

7
00:00:25,028 --> 00:00:28,144
Wow! So when does
my shift end?

8
00:00:28,814 --> 00:00:31,382
Please see previous answer.

9
00:00:35,652 --> 00:00:37,436
Your customer.

10
00:00:37,506 --> 00:00:39,533
Welcome to Void Mart!

11
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:43,107
Psst. Pip.
Upsell the large one.
